    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "1:25:00 = **6:29/mi** (4:02/km) average.\n\n- **Miles 1–3:** 6:32–6:35. Resist the start. Crowd + adrenaline make 6:15 feel easy.\n- **Miles 4–10:** settle at 6:27–6:30. Hills: hold effort, not pace.\n- **Miles 11–13.1:** whatever you have left. If you're at 1:05:00 at mile 10, you have 20 min for 3.1 mi = 6:27/mi to get under.\n\nCheckpoints: 5K ≈ 20:10, 10K ≈ 40:15, 10 mi ≈ 1:04:55."
     ]
    },
