     "parts": [
      "Congratulations, sub-1:25! That's a well-executed race if you negative split. It means the conservative start worked.\n\nFor the next few days:\n- Easy days or rest for 3–5 days; legs often feel fine before tendons and muscles have actually recovered.\n- Normal carbs + protein to refill.\n- When you're ready, write down a few notes on what worked (breakfast, gel timing, pacing). It's the best input for the next block."
     ]
